<%- include("../partials/head") %>
<body>
    <%- include("../partials/main-sidebar") %>
    <main class="padding responsive">
        <div class="hero">
            <div class="hero-content tertiary-text">
              <h2>Skål Club</h2>
              <h5>Find your next favourite beer and bar.</h5>
            </div>
          </div>
        <div class="large-padding">
            <h2>Cheers! Skål! Kanpai!!&#x1F37A;&#x2728; </h2>
            <p>Welcome to Skål Club, a space for beer lovers and curious explorers. Here, you can discover different beer styles, learn what makes them unique, and find inspiration for your next favorite pint. This site celebrates the creativity and diversity of beer culture in a simple and approachable way.</p>
            <p>You’ll also find my personal recommendations for craft beer bars in Stockholm, along with tips and ideas to help you explore new flavors. Take a look around, follow your curiosity, and enjoy the journey. Skål!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="large-padding">
            <h4>Today's Luckey Beer</h4>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="grid gap  middle-align padding">
                <div class="small-width small-height padding shape sided-cookie12 rotate s12 m6 l3">
                    <img class="responsive" src="<%= todaysBeer.image %>">
                </div>
                <div class="s12 m6 l3">
                    <h5><%= todaysBeer.name %></h5>
                    <p><%= todaysBeer.description %></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>